            Customer Support &amp; Technical Administration
          </h3>
          <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-soft-gray/85 leading-relaxed">
            Isolated engineering bay for client confidentiality, rapid STEP/IGES data translation, CAD design review, production scheduling, and real-time vendor dispatch tracking.
          </p>
