            <p class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-cyber-blue mt-1 font-semibold">Customized Toolroom Machining</p>
          </div>
          <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-soft-gray/85 leading-relaxed">
            Dedicated toolroom auxiliary equipment tailored for mold-base squaring, rapid side-pocketing, copper electrode prep, and customized fixture fabrication.
          </p>
          <div class="bg-navy-deep/80 p-space-md rounded border border-rich-gold/20 space-y-space-xs font-body-sm text-body-sm">
            <div class="flex justify-between font-data-mono text-label-caps">
              <span class="text-soft-gray/70">Primary Domain</span>
              <span class="font-bold text-white">Toolroom Operations</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between font-data-mono text-label-caps">
              <span class="text-soft-gray/70">Application Range</span>
              <span class="text-white font-semibold">Bolster &amp; Base Plates</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between font-data-mono text-label-caps">
              <span class="text-soft-gray/70">Speed Flexibility</span>
              <span class="text-white font-semibold">Rapid Setup Capable</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-space-lg flex items-center gap-space-xs text-emerald-400 font-label-caps text-label-caps font-semibold">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">check_circle</span>
          <span>Calibrated &amp; Operating in Production</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Machine 3: Surface Grinding -->
      <div class="card-tech-gold rounded-xl p-space-lg shadow-xl flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-rich-gold transition-all">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-space-md">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-dark-slate border border-rich-gold/40 text-rich-gold font-label-caps text-label-caps rounded font-bold">1x MACHINE DEPLOYED</span>
            <span class="font-data-mono text-label-caps text-rich-gold font-semibold">ASSET ID: GRD-SRF-03</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-heading-gold text-headline-sm text-rich-gold font-bold">Surface Grinding Machine</h3>
            <p class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-cyber-blue mt-1 font-semibold">Accurate Finishing &amp; Planarity</p>
          </div>
          <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-soft-gray/85 leading-relaxed">
            Delivers micro-level flatness, parting-line shut-off perfection, and high surface parallelism indispensable for flash-free injection and insert molding dies.
          </p>
          <div class="bg-navy-deep/80 p-space-md rounded border border-rich-gold/20 space-y-space-xs font-body-sm text-body-sm">
            <div class="flex justify-between font-data-mono text-label-caps">
              <span class="text-soft-gray/70">Primary Domain</span>
              <span class="font-bold text-white">Die Parting &amp; Inserts</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between font-data-mono text-label-caps">
              <span class="text-soft-gray/70">Surface Finish</span>
              <span class="text-cyber-blue font-bold">Ra &lt; 0.2 µm Finish</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between font-data-mono text-label-caps">
              <span class="text-soft-gray/70">Parallelism</span>
              <span class="text-white font-semibold">Micron Alignment</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-space-lg flex items-center gap-space-xs text-emerald-400 font-label-caps text-label-caps font-semibold">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">check_circle</span>
          <span>Calibrated &amp; Operating in Production</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

