      <div>
        <span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-cyber-blue font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider block mb-space-xs">03 // Technical Leadership &amp; Governance</span>
        <h2 class="font-heading-gold text-headline-lg text-rich-gold font-bold">Executive Leadership &amp; Functional Hierarchy</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-soft-gray/80 max-w-lg">
        Hands-on technocrats combining 30+ cumulative years in precision toolroom leadership, medical device standards, and cross-functional operational governance.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Unified Architectural Framework Container -->
